     1930     :
     1931       PUT stream PrnLibStream SPACE(10) ReportNAme format "X(100)" SKIP .
     1932       PUT stream PrnLibStream str1 format "X(100)" SKIP .
     1933       put stream PrnLibStream  skip cur-time-print() format "x(35)" string( "Страница" ) AT 45 PAGE-NUMBER( PrnLibStream ) AT 55 FORMAT ">>9" SKIP .
     1934       put stream PrnLibStream
     1935         skip  Line format "X(113)"  skip
     1936         "|"           " Дата"     format "X(5)"
     1937         "|" at 13  "Тип"       format "X(3)"
     1938         "|" at 17  " № док-та" format "X(10)"
     1939         "|" at 47  " № наклад" format "X(10)"
     1940         "|" at 70  string(" Сумма (" + s-val + ")")  format "X(15)"
     1941         "|" at 95  string(" Сальдо (" + s-val + ")") format "X(17)"
     1942         "|" at 120
     1943         skip  Line format "X(113)"  skip
     1944       .
     1945     end.
     1946   end procedure.
